===Receive comms from the Xianzhou{{subst:void|<!--202200101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Parlor Car|Before embarking on the next stop of their journey, the Express received a comms from the Xianzhou Luofu &mdash; Jing Yuan extended an invite to all wanderers to join the Wardance.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|undefined}} Investigate
:{{tx}}
:'''System:''' You have an interstellar message. Please check it promptly.
:{{tx}}
:'''Himeko:''' Well, things are getting lively. We've barely recovered from The Family's Charmony Festival, and we're already being invited to another special event.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Trailblazing is all about having fun.
::'''March 7th:''' Why not think about it this way. Our trailblazing expeditions are turning into "blast expeditions," where we eat, drink, and play wherever we go.
::'''Pom-Pom:''' Blast... expedition?
::'''March 7th:''' Yeah, wherever we go, we eat, play, and have a blast!
::I'm still recovering from the trauma caused by the last "festivity."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm still recovering from the trauma caused by the last "festivity."
:'''March 7th:''' Yeah, me too!
:'''March 7th:''' But wait, won't it look unprofessional if we attend two ceremonies in a row? Aren't we supposed to be focused on restoring astral charts and doing some serious scientific exploration?
:'''Dan Heng:''' So, we should leave March behind to take care of the Express?
:'''March 7th:''' H&mdash;Hey! That's not what I meant! I'm all for some fun... I just hope there won't be any surprise party crashers like Friday or Saturday.
:'''Welt:''' The Xianzhou Luofu has recently overcome a crisis. By holding the Wardance, they're demonstrating to everyone that they've returned to a state of peace and safety.
:'''March 7th:''' But that's what everyone said before we went to Penacony! "You'll be totally safe under The Family's protection!"
:'''Dan Heng:''' No need to worry. The Wardance is not like the Charmony Festival with all its hidden secrets. It's just a festival to honor the Reignbow Arbiter and the Cloud Knights who fought against the Abominations of Abundance and protected the Xianzhou ships.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Aside from starskiff performances, it's mostly martial contests, nothing too different from the Taikiyan Roboball contest we've seen before.
:'''Welt:''' What do you think, Himeko? Since we've accepted Miss Black Swan's proposal, we should probably head to Amphoreus for refueling.
:'''Himeko:''' Mm, there's certainly no rush. This trailblazing expedition is quite unique, and the Express needs to be fully stocked and prepared before moving on to the next stop.
:'''Himeko:''' With Madam Herta's help, I was planning to deliver some Leviathan fossils from Calenga Abyss to Ruan Mei, member #81 of the Genius Society. It could earn us some favors before we set off. However, it may take a few weeks.
:'''March 7th:''' Ah, so that means... we're not going to the Luofu.
:'''Himeko:''' Being an adult means maintaining relationships, whether we like it or not, March. Since we've been invited, it's only right for the Astral Express to attend the ceremony.
:'''Himeko:''' So, here's the plan: Pom-Pom will take everyone to the Xianzhou Luofu. Mr. Yang and I will meet up with Ruan Mei and fulfill our promise. Meanwhile, (Trailblazer), March, and Dan Heng will represent the Express and attend the Wardance.
:'''Welt:''' What do you two think, (Trailblazer) and Dan Heng?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds great. Let's split into groups!
::'''Welt:''' I don't hear any objections.
::I want to play with Leviathan fossils, too!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to play with Leviathan fossils, too!
:'''March 7th:''' Himeko and Mr. Yang will be busy with serious research. Besides, fossils can't compete with martial contests when it comes to fun, right?
:'''March 7th:''' Plus, you're the only one with so many friends on the Luofu. I'll be lost if you don't come along! You've got to lead the way.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' Now that everyone's on board with the plan, it's time to warp to the Xianzhou Luofu.
:{{tx}}
