===(Optional) Discuss the travel plan with the other members of the Express Crew{{subst:void|<!--202200103-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:'''Welt:''' Calenga Abyss... what does she expect to find there? Current research on Leviathan merely proves how little we know about such life forms...
:'''Himeko:''' That's why geniuses are interested in that field. Science is all about uncovering the unknown...
:The conversation between the two adults brims with complex jargon, from "Assumptive Astrobiological Chemistry" to "Trans-dimensional Evolutionary Theory," filling the carriage with an air of dense perplexity.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Have a safe trip, you two.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Come back soon.
:'''Himeko:''' Don't miss us too much, (Trailblazer). If I stumble upon some cool Leviathan fossils, I'll bring a few back as souvenirs for you.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

